    @* Start Section children’s education important*@
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
        <div class="col-md-6 " style="text-align:justify;font-size:18px;">
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em">
                Technical School
            </h1>
            <p>Human Relief Missions technical school offers orphans a unique opportunity to receive both education and practical skills. Recognising the economic challenges faced by families in Afghanistan. The apprenticeship model employed by the technical school allows orphans to engage in traditional learning activities based on the local curriculum such as reading, writing, and expressing their ideas. However, what sets this program apart is that for a significant portion of their school day, students get the chance to observe and learn directly from skilled mechanics in our workshops.</p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/techical-school/workshop.jpg" alt="work shop pic" style="width:100%" />
            </p>
            <p>Our approach ensures that orphans not only gain academic knowledge but also acquire practical skills, providing them with a viable means of earning a steady living after completing their education. By integrating these real-world experiences into their schooling, the technical school offers a pathway for orphans to lead self-sufficient lives without the necessity of pursuing higher education or attending university. This holistic approach to education equips them with the tools to thrive and contribute meaningfully to their families and communities.</p>
            @* Start Qoute Section*@
            <div class="" style="padding-bottom:50px;margin-top:30px;">

                <div class="quote-container col-md-12">
                    <span class="" style="font-size:4em;font-weight:bold">&lsquo;&lsquo;</span>
                    <p class="quote">
                        The Prophet ﷺ said: “I and the one who sponsors an orphan shall be in Paradise like these two” – he raised his index finger and the one next to it, holding them together
                    </p>
                    <p class="">Hadith | Bukhari </p>
                </div>

            </div>
            @* End Qoute Section*@
            <p>&nbsp;</p>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    </div>
    @* Start Section children’s education important*@


    @* Start Section values education for children*@
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
        <div class="col-md-6 " style="text-align:justify;font-size:18px;">
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em">
                HRM values education for children
            </h1>
            <p>At Human Relief Mission, we believe in the need to educate, learn, and grow – helping each child to gain a vital education, learn much-needed skills and grow into a bright and happy future insha’Allah.</p>
            <p>We’re committed to breaking the ongoing cycle of poverty that so many children face. We want to ensure that all children receive at least primary schooling and that adults are taught to read and write too.</p>
            <p>Human Relief Mission build and rehabilitate schools, stocking and equipping them to provide quality teaching. We train teachers so that they give the best education possible, and support schools with milk and nutritional meals, to ensure that children are healthy enough to concentrate and learn. As well as this, we work with adults, teaching them in ways that work best for their situation and culture to facilitate learning in the safest way possible to transform lives.</p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/techical-school/technical-school-2.jpg" style="width:100%" />
            </p>
            <p>
                By supporting us you can provide a child or adult with a brighter future free from poverty. You can help educate others and enable them to learn and grow a stable future.
                Your charity can transform lives by providing education for children. Donate and give charity to our education projects now.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    </div>
    @* END Section values education for children*@

