            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em;">
                What does the Quran say about education?
            </h1>
            <p>The Qur’an repeatedly encourages Muslims to seek knowledge, in order to gain success. </p>
            <p>Numerous verses highlight the importance of education, such as:</p>

            @* Start Qoute Section 1 *@
            <div class="" style="padding-bottom:50px;margin-top:30px;">

                <div class="quote-container col-md-12" style="background-color: #660199; color: #fff; box-shadow: none;">
